OL,3,A70,000 social and affordable homes to
OL,4,Abe built across England as part of
OL,5,A#39bn plan
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters have announced where 70,000
OL,8,Fsocial and affordable homes will be
OL,9,Fbuilt in England over the next 10
OL,10,Fyears, in a bid to address the housing
OL,11,Fcrisis.
OL,13,FFunding has been granted to Greater
OL,14,FManchester, the West Midlands, West
OL,15,FYorkshire, South Yorkshire, North East
OL,16,FEngland, and Liverpool, as well as #6bn
OL,17,Ffor London.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
